00:49:40.920 --> 00:49:42.990
the image recognition
features, all of these,

00:49:42.990 --> 00:49:45.810
we're bringing that into
AODocs to add even more value

00:49:45.810 --> 00:49:46.747
to your documents.

00:49:46.747 --> 00:49:48.330
THORSTEN LUEDECKE:
Thank you, Stephan.

00:49:48.330 --> 00:49:50.400
I know there are so many
features that you have.

