Bohren here with us today.

00:50:09.540 --> 00:50:10.200
Hello, Eric.

00:50:10.200 --> 00:50:11.450
ERIC BOHREN: Thanks, Thorsten.

00:50:11.450 --> 00:50:13.783
THORSTEN LUEDECKE: And who
