critical to the productivity

00:52:03.930 --> 00:52:06.480
of your stores, in 2014.

00:52:06.480 --> 00:52:08.310
So you're really
leading the curve

00:52:08.310 --> 00:52:10.410
in terms of moving
communications with cloud.

00:52:10.410 --> 00:52:12.150
What kind of
comfort did you give

00:52:12.150 --> 00:52:15.210
to your key stakeholders
in FOSSIL group

00:52:15.210 --> 00:52:17.730
